            "prompt": "Production portrait4:5 puzzle illustration, target1280x1600. Cozy dimensional storybook digital painting with soft visible brushed surfaces, highly crafted readable objects, warm upper-left daylight, natural coherent perspective and tasteful color, not a photograph. No city landmark, names, text, labels, logos, people, UI, frame or watermark. Attractive complete CLEAN BACKGROUND for five later independently painted moving details: paint all surfaces fully with no holes or placeholder marks. A cozy hotelwindowseat with a soft leathertravelbag, intimateeye-levelview. WARM IVORY dominates cushionedwindowseat, paleplasterwalls andlarge ivorycurtain at far right, tinywarm leather/sageaccents. Genericgarden outside broadwindow, no landmark. Left half ofwindow has barebrassrod and no curtainyet, rightcurtainpermanent. Small plantpotrearupperright x84%,y38% hasbarestem. Shortroundside table atx51%,y75% withtinyemptyivorybudvase. Closedcaramelleathertravelbag restswindowseat atx60%,y60% withplainhandle, no decorativeribbon. An exposedsmallpegonleftwall nearx27%,y44% withno hangingtie. Laterfiveparts:smallivorycurtainonleftrod, rootedsoftgreenplantsprig, tinycreamcosmosinvase, shortsoftsageribbon tiedtobaghandle, thincreamcloth tieonwallpeg. Paintcompletecozyroomwiththese fivepiecesomitted.",
