            "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: production transparent painted animation cutout atlas for a cozy travel jigsaw. Make a TRUE transparent RGBA image, transparent space between subjects (no opaque backdrop, no paper rectangle, no glow, no grid, no checkerboard). Exactly FIVE independent watercolor/gouache cutouts arranged 3 columns by 2 rows, sixth bottom-right cell entirely empty. Every subject fully contained inside its own cell with very wide transparent gutters, nothing crosses halfway horizontal divider or any column divider. Keep each subject below 360px tall in 512x512 cell, centered. Soft hand-painted pigment and fine brushwork, warm gentle daylight from upper left, natural modest saturation; no text or UI. Subjects are detailed parts from a whole cozy illustrated scene, not stickers, no outline, no artificial rim or drop shadow. An ivory hotel window seat and leather travel bag scene. TOP LEFT: a narrow soft cream curtain panel with tiny top hanging loops. TOP MIDDLE: a small eucalyptus leaf sprig on a bottom cut stem. TOP RIGHT: a single ivory cosmos flower on a long slender bottom stem. BOTTOM LEFT: a tiny sage ribbon tied into a knot with two short hanging tails, top knot anchor to bag handle. BOTTOM MIDDLE: a thin loosely knotted cream cloth tie, top loop anchor to wall peg, hangs vertically. Five separate subjects.",
